<header class="hdr" data-header>
  <div class="hdr__main">
    <div class="wrap hdr__row">

      <button class="iconbtn hide-lg" data-open="menu" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">
        {% render 'icon', name: 'menu', size: 22 %}
      </button>

      <a class="brand-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}" aria-label="{{ shop.name }} — home">
        {% render 'brand-mark' %}
      </a>

      <form class="hdr__search hide-sm" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search"
            data-search-form>
        {% render 'icon', name: 'search', size: 18 %}
        <label class="sr" for="hdr-q">Search products</label>
        <input id="hdr-q" type="search" name="q" autocomplete="off"
               data-rotating-placeholder='["Ashwagandha","Hair fall","Liver detox","Glowing skin","Shilajit","Magnesium"]'
               placeholder="Search for “Ashwagandha”">
        <div class="hdr__suggest" data-suggest hidden></div>
      </form>

      <div class="hdr__actions">
        <a class="hdr__call hide-sm" href="tel:{{ settings.phone | replace: ' ', '' }}">
          {% render 'icon', name: 'phone', size: 16 %}
          <span>
            <b>{{ settings.phone }}</b>
            <small>{{ settings.call_hours }}</small>
          </span>
        </a>
        <a class="iconbtn hide-sm" href="{{ routes.account_url }}" aria-label="Account">
          {% render 'icon', name: 'user', size: 20 %}
        </a>
        <button class="iconbtn" data-open="cart" aria-label="Open cart">
          {% render 'icon', name: 'cart', size: 20 %}
          <span class="iconbtn__count" data-cart-count {% if cart.item_count == 0 %}hidden{% endif %}>{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Phone search. The Man Company keeps a full-width bar on screen rather than
    hiding search behind an icon, which is the right call for a catalogue people
    arrive at with a symptom in mind. Sits under the masthead, above the banner —
    never over it, so it cannot cover the artwork.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="hdr__msearch-wrap hide-lg">
    <form class="hdr__msearch" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search"
          data-search-form>
      {% render 'icon', name: 'search', size: 18 %}
      <label class="sr" for="m-q">Search products</label>
      <input id="m-q" type="search" name="q" autocomplete="off"
             data-rotating-placeholder='["hair serum","ashwagandha","liver detox","glowing skin","shilajit"]'
             placeholder="Search for hair serum">
      <div class="hdr__suggest" data-suggest hidden></div>
    </form>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Desktop primary navigation. The eight concerns live inside a mega panel
    rather than a flat rail — at 1440px the rail ran off the right edge and the
    last two concerns were unreachable.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <nav class="hdr__nav" aria-label="Main">
    <div class="wrap hdr__nav-row">

      <div class="hdr__drop" data-drop>
        <button class="hdr__navlink hdr__navlink--drop" data-drop-btn aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true">
          Shop by concern
          {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron', size: 14 %}
        </button>

        <div class="hdr__mega" data-drop-panel hidden>
          <div class="wrap hdr__mega-in">
            <div class="hdr__mega-grid">
              {%- for c in concerns -%}
                <a class="megaitem" href="{{ c.url }}">
                  <span class="megaitem__t">{{ c.label }}<i>{{ c.count }}</i></span>
                  <span class="megaitem__s">{{ c.tagline }}</span>
                </a>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>

            <div class="hdr__mega-side">
              <span class="t-mono hdr__mega-lbl">Not sure where to start</span>
              <a class="megatool" href="/pages/ritual-builder">
                {% render 'icon', name: 'leaf', size: 18 %}
                <span><b>Build your ritual</b><small>A routine across the whole day</small></span>
              </a>
              <a class="megatool" href="/pages/label-check">
                {% render 'icon', name: 'flask', size: 18 %}
                <span><b>Read the label</b><small>Compare two formulas by dose</small></span>
              </a>
              <a class="megatool" href="/pages/consultancy">
                {% render 'icon', name: 'phone', size: 18 %}
                <span><b>Free consultation</b><small>Talk to an Ayurvedic expert</small></span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a class="hdr__navlink" href="/collections/all">Shop all</a>
      <a class="hdr__navlink" href="/collections/best-sellers">Best sellers</a>
      <a class="hdr__navlink" href="/pages/ritual-builder">Build a ritual</a>
      <a class="hdr__navlink" href="/pages/label-check">Read the label</a>
      <a class="hdr__navlink" href="/pages/ingredients">Ingredients</a>
      <a class="hdr__navlink hdr__navlink--gold" href="/pages/consultancy">Free consultancy</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

</header>

{%- comment -%} Mobile drawer {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="drawer drawer--left" data-panel="menu" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="drawer__hd">
    <span class="t-mono">Menu</span>
    <button class="iconbtn" data-close aria-label="Close menu">{% render 'icon', name: 'close', size: 20 %}</button>
  </div>
  <div class="drawer__body">
    <nav class="mnav" aria-label="Main">
      <span class="mnav__grp t-mono">Shop by concern</span>
      {%- for c in concerns -%}
        <a class="mnav__link" href="{{ c.url }}">{{ c.label }}<i>{{ c.count }}</i></a>
      {%- endfor -%}
      <span class="mnav__grp t-mono">Tools</span>
      <a class="mnav__link" href="/pages/ritual-builder">Build Your Ritual</a>
      <a class="mnav__link" href="/pages/label-check">Read the Label</a>
      <a class="mnav__link" href="/pages/ingredients">Ingredient Library</a>
      <span class="mnav__grp t-mono">More</span>
      <a class="mnav__link" href="/collections/all">Shop all</a>
      <a class="mnav__link" href="/collections/best-sellers">Best sellers</a>
      <a class="mnav__link" href="/pages/consultancy">Free Consultancy</a>
      <a class="mnav__link" href="/pages/about">About Helbrede</a>
      <a class="mnav__link" href="/pages/contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="drawer__foot">
    <a class="btn btn--primary btn--block" href="tel:{{ settings.phone | replace: ' ', '' }}">
      {% render 'icon', name: 'phone', size: 16 %} Call to order
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Header",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "sticky", "label": "Stick to top on scroll", "default": true }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
